  "description": "Add depth, texture, and elegant floral charm to your designs with this Teal Paper Flowers Seamless Pattern Collection. Inspired by handcrafted paper flowers and layered paper-cut art, this collection features dimensional floral elements in rich teal tones for a modern yet artistic look.\nEach pattern is carefully designed with a clean seamless repeat, making it ideal for fabric, wallpaper, stationery, and print-on-demand products. The paper-texture florals bring a refined handmade feel while remaining versatile for both contemporary and classic design projects.\n👉 You will receive a total of 34 seamless patterns, all high-resolution and fully tileable for professional-quality results.\nWhat’s Included\n– 34 High-resolution seamless patterns\n– File format: JPEG (high resolution)\n– Size: 3072 × 3072 px\n– Seamless and tileable for large-scale printing\n– Teal paper flower and layered floral illustrations\n– Fully editable: resize, rotate, recolor, or layer as needed\nKey Features\n– Paper-cut style floral designs\n– Elegant teal and jewel-tone color palette\n– Seamless repeating pattern format\n– High-resolution quality for print and digital use\n– Handmade, dimensional, and artistic aesthetic\nPerfect For\n– Fabric, textile, and wallpaper projects\n– Wrapping paper and packaging\n– Scrapbooking and creative journals\n– Planner covers and stationery\n– Print-on-demand products\n– Home décor and wall art\n– Floral branding and decorative accents\n– Seamless pattern and digital paper use\nNote\nThis is a digital product. No physical items will be shipped.\nColors may vary slightly depending on monitor and printer settings.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add depth, texture, and elegant floral charm to your designs with this Teal Paper Flowers Seamless Pattern Collection. Inspired by handcrafted paper flowers and layered paper-cut art, this collection features dimensional floral elements in rich teal tones for a modern yet artistic look.</p>\n<p>Each pattern is carefully designed with a clean seamless repeat, making it ideal for fabric, wallpaper, stationery, and print-on-demand products. The paper-texture florals bring a refined handmade feel while remaining versatile for both contemporary and classic design projects.</p>\n<p>👉 You will receive a total of 34 seamless patterns, all high-resolution and fully tileable for professional-quality results.</p>\n<p>What’s Included</p>\n<p>– 34 High-resolution seamless patterns<br>\n– File format: JPEG (high resolution)<br>\n– Size: 3072 × 3072 px<br>\n– Seamless and tileable for large-scale printing<br>\n– Teal paper flower and layered floral illustrations<br>\n– Fully editable: resize, rotate, recolor, or layer as needed</p>\n<p>Key Features</p>\n<p>– Paper-cut style floral designs<br>\n– Elegant teal and jewel-tone color palette<br>\n– Seamless repeating pattern format<br>\n– High-resolution quality for print and digital use<br>\n– Handmade, dimensional, and artistic aesthetic</p>\n<p>Perfect For</p>\n<p>– Fabric, textile, and wallpaper projects<br>\n– Wrapping paper and packaging<br>\n– Scrapbooking and creative journals<br>\n– Planner covers and stationery<br>\n– Print-on-demand products<br>\n– Home décor and wall art<br>\n– Floral branding and decorative accents<br>\n– Seamless pattern and digital paper use</p>\n<p>Note</p>\n<p>This is a digital product. No physical items will be shipped.<br>\nColors may vary slightly depending on monitor and printer settings.</p>",
